TYPES: #eg-0309 screenplay, creativework, writtenwork

PRE-MARKUP:

Example of a screenplay.

MICRODATA:

HTML
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork">
  <h1 itemprop="name">A Good Screenplay</h1>

  <span itemprop="genre">Example</span>

  <div itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <span itemprop="name">Joe</span>
  </div>

  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-12-25">

  <meta itemprop="inLanguage" content="en">

  <div itemprop="countryOfOrigin" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Country">
    <span itemprop="name">Brazil</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="copyrightHolder" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <span itemprop="name">Joe</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="encoding" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/MediaObject">
    <link itemprop="contentUrl" href="https://example.com/a-good-screenplay.pdf">
    <meta itemprop="encodingFormat" content="application/pdf">
  </div>
</div>


